	"Description": "Build game UI in markup and stylesheets, with a live preview that lays out exactly as the engine does. Text and vector art are distance fields, so a screen stays sharp at any size or DPI. The same document runs diegetically in the world - drawn after tonemapping, as scene geometry, or onto a surface - readable and interactive from across the room.",
